<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine hydroelectric sale declared void.</title>
<headline>Argentine hydroelectric sale declared void.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A privatization tender for the Pichi Picun Leufu hydroelectric dam in southern Argentina was declared void after no bids were received, the government said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Energy Secretary Carlos Serrano was quoted by state-run news agency Telam saying that officials would meet in the next few days to ponder what to do next about the dam, which is on the River Limay.</p>
<p>Some $131 million will have to be spent to finish construction of the dam.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0657))</p>
</text>
